  "raw_text": "ause everyone I've ever got has been pretty moist and juicy even sometimes. So I definitely wouldn't want to eat one if it was dry. Cold, I don't think I'd want to eat it cold either. You definitely want it warm or hot. Agent: Understood, so dry and cold would definitely make it less enjoyable. If the Mexican Pizza was unavailable, what would you order instead, including the chain and the specific item? User: If I was ordering from Taco Bell, I would probably just get one of their soft-shell tacos or maybe like one of their rice and bean burritos. Agent: And why would a soft-shell taco or a rice and bean burrito be the closest replacement for the Mexican Pizza for you? User: To me, it wouldn't be a replacement because it's not close. I don't think it's very close to those items, to the pizza, but it would be my second favorite option. Agent: I understand that they aren't close replacements, but rather your next preferred options. Thank you for clarifying. Now, could you name two or th",
